+# Plan
+
+## 1. Tests
+
+- [ ] 1.1 Check that injectSourcesContent keeps the sourcesContent entries a map already carries, even for sources that are not on disk, and prints no warning (packages/vite/src/node/server/__tests__/sourcemap.spec.ts) [AC-1]
+- [ ] 1.2 Check that a null entry is still read from the source file, that sourceRoot is honoured, and that a source neither carried nor on disk still warns once (packages/vite/src/node/server/__tests__/sourcemap.spec.ts) [AC-2]
+
+## 2. Sourcemap content
+
+- [ ] 2.1 Fill only the missing sourcesContent entries from disk (packages/vite/src/node/server/sourcemap.ts)
+- [ ] 2.2 Always run the content injection for served JS, HTML proxy modules and CSS, instead of skipping maps that already carry some content (packages/vite/src/node/server/transformRequest.ts, packages/vite/src/node/server/middlewares/indexHtml.ts, packages/vite/src/node/plugins/css.ts)
